{"t_ms": 943187, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s0_014", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Room Amenities Guide\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery guest room is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a smart television, electronic safe, telephone, minibar, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled drinking water, premium toiletries, fresh towels, and a hairdryer. Additional amenities such as an iron, ironing board, or extra pillows can be requested through housekeeping.", "Indoor Games Room\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests can enjoy a variety of indoor recreational activities including table tennis, carrom, chess, billiards, and board games. The Games Room is open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM. Equipment should be returned after use, and guests are requested to maintain a quiet and respectful environment.", "Deluxe Room Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Deluxe Room offers a comfortable stay with a king-size bed, air conditioning, a smart TV, complimentary Wi-Fi, tea and coffee-making facilities, and a work desk. Each room includes an attached bathroom with premium toiletries and a hairdryer. The room accommodates up to two adults and one child. Daily housekeeping is included in the room rate."], "scores": [0.4825301766395569, 0.5877431631088257, 0.6309415102005005], "filenames": ["14_room_amenities.txt", "37_games_room.txt", "11_deluxe_room.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 47, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
